        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Risk factors—Risks relating to our business—We are not, and may not be in the future, the sole owner or operator of all of our licensed areas and do not, and may not in the future, hold all of the working interests in certain of our licensed areas.",
        "start_character": 136455,
        "end_character": 136703
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-037819",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-037819-38673f7dc6b943b1",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-037819",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are committed to avoiding operations in legally protected areas and taking into account biodiversity value and ecosystem services as a driver to design, plan and execute our projects.",
        "start_character": 146026,
        "end_character": 146212
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-037819",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-037819-38673f7dc6b943b1",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-037819",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We have grown our business through drilling, developing and producing oil and gas, winning new licenses and acquiring strategic assets and businesses.",
        "start_character": 24747,
        "end_character": 24897
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-037819",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-037819-38673f7dc6b943b1",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-037819",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We intend to continue to focus on maintaining a risk-balanced portfolio of assets, combining cash flow-generating assets with upside potential opportunities, and on increasing production and reserves through finding, developing and producing oil and gas reserves in the countries in which we operate.",
        "start_character": 33103,
        "end_character": 33403
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-037819",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-037819-38673f7dc6b943b1",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-037819",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Across all countries where we operate, we ensure compliance with applicable health, safety and environmental requirements.",
        "start_character": 142476,
        "end_character": 142598
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-037819",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-037819-38673f7dc6b943b1",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-037819",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Additionally, given the inherent oil price volatility, we design our work programs to be flexible, which means that they can be increased or decreased depending on the oil price scenario.",
        "start_character": 36171,
        "end_character": 36358
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-037819",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-037819-38673f7dc6b943b1",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-037819",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "As part of this plan, we are carrying out more than 8 circular initiatives as part of the three (3) circularity models that we have prioritized: i) water management, ii) waste management, and iii) use of gas.",
        "start_character": 151195,
        "end_character": 151403
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-037819",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-037819-38673f7dc6b943b1",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-037819",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "At the same time, we are advancing the accelerated development of our unconventional position in Vaca Muerta, a strategic platform that is expected to expand and diversify our future production and cash flow profile, subject to market conditions and operational execution.",
        "start_character": 7315,
        "end_character": 7587
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-037819",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-037819-38673f7dc6b943b1",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-037819",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "During 2024 and 2025, we executed offtake and prepayment agreements with Vitol, Trafigura and BP to sell production from our producing blocks in the Llanos Basin, mainly Llanos 34, Llanos 123 and CPO-5.",
        "start_character": 137177,
        "end_character": 137379
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-037819",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-037819-38673f7dc6b943b1",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-037819",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "During the year ended December 31, 2025, we had 1.3 mmboe of our proved undeveloped reserves from December 31, 2024, converted to proved developed reserves due to development drilling in the Llanos 123 and Llanos 34 Blocks in Colombia.",
        "start_character": 78906,
        "end_character": 79141
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-037819",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-037819-38673f7dc6b943b1",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-037819",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "For GeoPark, results are measured not only in production, reserves and cash flow, but also in the health and safety of our people and the value we create for shareholders and the communities where we operate.",
        "start_character": 4704,
        "end_character": 4912
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-037819",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-037819-38673f7dc6b943b1",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-037819",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "For the remaining 35% of the production from the Loma Jarillosa Este Block and 100% of the production from the Puesto Silva Oeste Block, we sell to Trafigura Argentina S.A.",
        "start_character": 107164,
        "end_character": 107336
      }
    ]
  },
